OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F371A1785761308
OL,3,CLondon drought: Water storage drops
OL,4,C15% in a month and risk of leaks rises
OL,6,FWater in London's reservoirs is
OL,7,Fcontinuing to drop with storage down
OL,8,F15 per cent in a month, Thames Water
OL,9,Fsaid.
OL,11,FThe company's Water Director said
OL,12,Fthere was no risk of taps running dry
OL,13,Fbut 'every drop counts' during a
OL,14,Fdrought.
OL,16,F"It's been bone dry, we've not been
OL,17,Fable to abstract an awful lot of
OL,18,Fwater," said Martin Padley, Water
OL,19,FDirector at Thames Water.
OL,1,W h7}h7}j7}h7}h7}                 G1/7
OL,2,W+,"-'*%/*-'"-'*%/T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BLondon NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,372,370,120,260,000,100
PN,37102
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F371A1785761308
OL,3,CLondon drought: Water storage drops
OL,4,C15% in a month and risk of leaks rises
OL,6,F"But there is still water for
OL,7,Feverybody to drink, nobody needs to
OL,8,Fworry but it is quite an important
OL,9,Fsituation we're in at the moment," he
OL,10,Fadded.
OL,12,FLondon is officially in drought after
OL,13,Fthe exceptionally hot and dry summer
OL,14,Fleft rivers, reservoirs and
OL,15,Fgroundwater much lower than normal.
OL,17,FA drought does not mean water is
OL,18,Frunning out but that supplies are
OL,19,Funder enough pressure that action is
OL,20,Fneeded to protect water resources and
OL,21,Fthe environment.
OL,1,W h7}h7}j7}h7}h7}                 G2/7
OL,2,W+,"-'*%/*-'"-'*%/T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BLondon NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,372,370,120,260,000,100
PN,37103
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F371A1785761308
OL,3,CLondon drought: Water storage drops
OL,4,C15% in a month and risk of leaks rises
OL,6,FWater is also harder to treat because
OL,7,Fit's warmer and contains more algae.
OL,8,FThe risk of leaks also rises.
OL,10,FMr Padley explained: "The leaks are
OL,11,Ffor two reasons. One, the ground moves
OL,12,Fand secondly, the pipes expand and
OL,13,Fthey crash into each other and then
OL,14,Fcrack around their joints.
OL,16,F"No body can predict the weather. One
OL,17,Fof the most dangerous droughts that
OL,18,Fyou can have is a winter drought.
OL,1,W h7}h7}j7}h7}h7}                 G3/7
OL,2,W+,"-'*%/*-'"-'*%/T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BLondon NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,372,370,120,260,000,100
PN,37104
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F371A1785761308
OL,3,CLondon drought: Water storage drops
OL,4,C15% in a month and risk of leaks rises
OL,6,F"So a summer drought we can work our
OL,7,Fway through. But a winter drought when
OL,8,Fthere's no rain, that's actually very,
OL,9,Fvery, very, very difficult to manage."
OL,11,F"We're at 74% storage at the moment.
OL,12,FThat's quite low compared to normal.
OL,13,FBut what is normal these days?
OL,15,F"It seems to be the new normal that
OL,16,Fevery summer we have a really, really
OL,17,Fhot baking summer these days.
OL,1,W h7}h7}j7}h7}h7}                 G4/7
OL,2,W+,"-'*%/*-'"-'*%/T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BLondon NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,372,370,120,260,000,100
PN,37105
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F371A1785761308
OL,3,CLondon drought: Water storage drops
OL,4,C15% in a month and risk of leaks rises
OL,6,F"What I really encourage people do is
OL,7,Fto conserve everything. Simple things
OL,8,Flike turn the tap off when people
OL,9,Fbrush their teeth."
OL,11,FThe UK Health Security Agency has
OL,12,Famber heat health alerts in place for
OL,13,FLondon until Wednesday morning, as the
OL,14,FMet Office said temperatures could
OL,15,Freach 35C on Monday.
OL,1,W h7}h7}j7}h7}h7}                 G5/7
OL,2,W+,"-'*%/*-'"-'*%/T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
