OL,24,ANext Page BLondon NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,372,370,120,260,000,100
PN,37106
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F371A1785761308
OL,3,CLondon drought: Water storage drops
OL,4,C15% in a month and risk of leaks rises
OL,6,FBut experts at the Met Office have
OL,7,Fwarned weather conditions in August
OL,8,Fare not looking favourable for
OL,9,Fdelivering the kind of sustained rain
OL,10,Fneeded to reverse the dry conditions
OL,11,Fthat have left all of Wales and half
OL,12,Fof England officially in drought.
OL,14,FJuly looks set to have been the driest
OL,15,Fon record for England and Wales, and
OL,16,Fsome places have had no rain for weeks.
OL,1,W h7}h7}j7}h7}h7}                 G6/7
OL,2,W+,"-'*%/*-'"-'*%/T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
