PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F371A1785761308
OL,3,CLondon drought: Water storage drops
OL,4,C15% in a month and risk of leaks rises
OL,6,FSome 23 million customers in England
OL,7,Fare under hosepipe bans, the harvest
OL,8,Fhas come early and farmers are warning
OL,9,Fof poor crop yields, livestock are
OL,10,Falready being fed winter feed, and
OL,11,Frivers and the natural environment are
OL,12,Fstruggling with low water levels.
OL,14,FSubscribe for free to our weekly
OL,15,Fnewsletter for exclusive and original
OL,16,Fcoverage from ITV News. Direct to your
OL,17,Finbox every Friday morning.
OL,1,W h7}h7}j7}h7}h7}                 G7/7
